  "description": "Blood Bowl Sevens Matched Play (Spike! Journal 22): a 600,000 gold draft, 7 to 11 players, at most 4 players without the Lineman keyword, and one Lineman as the Veteran (MA -1, one reroll a game). Rerolls 100k each (max 6), assistant coaches and cheerleaders 20k each (max 3), apothecary 80k, Dedicated Fans 20k each from 0 (max 5). Sevens inducements only (incl. Desperate Measures); no Star Players or Mercenaries. Skill Points by Sevens tier: Tier 1 = 1 ... Tier 4 = 4; a Primary costs 1, the team's one Secondary costs 2; one added skill per player, at most 2 Elite skills, and bought skills add no value. Tabletop only: Sevens teams can't be built on the fork.",
